":"\"You… you're that Fuuma, right? Nice to meet you from now on.\""},"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00029_1/uni00029_1_new_1.ogg"},{"type":"hom","label":"Home","variant":"base","index":1,"text":{"ja":"……なんだ、私は今は鍛錬中だ。ふうまは一人で遊びに行ってて","en":"\"...What? I'm currently training. Fuuma went off to play alone.\""},"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00029_1/uni00029_1_hom_1.ogg"},{"type":"hom","label":"Home","variant":"base","index":2,"text":{"ja":"？　私の顔に……何か、ついてるの？　え、可愛い……？","en":"\"? Something on my face? Huh, cute…?\""},"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00029_1/uni00029_1_hom_2.ogg"},{"type":"hom","label":"Home","variant":"base","index":3,"text":{"ja":"そんなにまじまじ見ないで……。やっぱり少し、恥ずかしいよ……","en":"\"Don't stare at me like that… It's a little embarrassing…\""},"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00029_1/uni00029_1_hom_3.ogg"},{"type":"hom","label":"Home","variant":"base","index":4,"text":{"ja":"ふうま、疲れてない？　ちょっと、肩揉んであげる","en":"\"Fuuma, you're tired? Let me give your shoulders a rub.\""},"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00029_1/uni00029_1_hom_4.ogg"},{"type":"hom","label":"Home","variant":"base","index":5,"text":{"ja":"触手？　触ってみたいって、それはダメだよ……さすがにね","en":"\"Tentacles? You want to touch them, that's not allowed… Not even for you.\""},"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00029_1/uni00029_1_hom_5.ogg"},{"type":"hom","label":"Home","variant":"base","index":6,"text":{"ja":"……ちょっと、視線、気づいてないと思ってる？　あんまり見ちゃダメだってー","en":"\"...Hey, you think I didn't notice your gaze? You really shouldn't be looking so much—\""},"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00029_1/uni00029_1_hom_6.ogg"},{"type":"hom","label":"Home","variant":"base","index":7,"text":{"ja":"はぁ……あ、ふうま。私だって、落ち込む時は落ち込むよ、これでも人間……だからね","en":"\"Sigh… Ah, Fuuma. Even I get down sometimes, I'm still human… you know.\""},"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00029_1/uni00029_1_hom_7.ogg"},{"type":"atk","label":"Attack","variant":"base","index":1,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00029_1/uni00029_1_atk_1.ogg"},{"type":"atk","label":"Attack","variant":"base","index":2,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00029_1/uni00029_1_atk_2.ogg"},{"type":"at